prompt_template:
You must respond with a single JSON object only — no markdown, no commentary.

Schema:
{
  "title": "string",
  "items": [{"name": "string", "priority": "low|medium|high"}],
  "summary": "string"
}

Example valid output:
{"title":"Weekly plan","items":[{"name":"Review PRs","priority":"high"}],"summary":"Focus on code review."}

Task: {task_description}
